{"uri": "at://did:plc:4rbsi3zu2tan23k3ehveyexi/app.bsky.feed.post/3lmaif6qn3z2f", "cid": "bafyreie3xfaevzzacdgewyug4pa67c2pyjf7v7cgh6op7eshfwbhcrkrga", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2025-04-07T17:30:05.837Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "In an ever more complex world, we think data is crucial to helping us make sense of things.  Some even claim data as information is the basis of the universe.  But critics claim there is a danger our…", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreid6cui5a7keeoxlyxxtru7orqclwnivi3yf6a6plrhkmmgjryxpuu"}, "mimeType": "image/webp", "size": 121448}, "title": "Data, deception, and truth", "uri": "https://iai.tv/video/data-deception-and-truth"}}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://iai.tv/video/data-deception-and-truth"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 56, "byteStart": 34}}, {"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:ho34pe25d3ywc6g6vxugre2i"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 78, "byteStart": 58}}, {"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:5u54z2qgkq43dh2nzwzdbbhb"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 107, "byteStart": 88}}, {"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:ubrcyykbscfmuyrfhktf2jvd"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 129, "byteStart": 110}}, {"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:4as576ot6tsyh7dsqb7m2net"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 155, "byteStart": 133}}, {"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:je6atyp5ctdtod47f5xda4rd"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 179, "byteStart": 158}}, {"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:mhzk3blh4pfxo3fqh2meowbb"}], "in