{"uri": "at://did:plc:je6atyp5ctdtod47f5xda4rd/app.bsky.feed.post/3lq5j7dzk722v", "cid": "bafyreif4bn3acq4v6hbdr3fjsqmld6vfipchyg4kjr2ltyd7qkjcr35de4", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2025-05-27T10:47:31.749Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "Artificial intelligence is a landmark technology, challenging what it means to be human. It exceeds our understanding, can combine information to generate", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreidizdr3k7sku4wvd2v7ryvcxlxtycrrcuxrpdivz3fpkccdlgpawm"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 950226}, "title": "Making Sense of AI: Silicon, Sacredness and Humanity - Woodbrooke", "uri": "https://www.woodbrooke.org.uk/courses/making-sense-of-ai-silicon-sacredness-and-humanity/"}}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.woodbrooke.org.uk/courses/making-sense-of-ai-silicon-sacredness-and-humanity/"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 231, "byteStart": 194}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "What does AI mean for religion? Can AI enrich faith - or is it the very idolatry we're warned against?\n\nJoin me for a course I'm giving at the Quaker learning institute, Woodbrooke Centre, at: \nwww.woodbrooke.org.uk/courses/maki..."}, "indexedAt": "2025-05-27T10:47:34.549Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 2, "like": 2, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:je6atyp5ctdtod47f5xda4rd"}
